      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING HORNET (3) was a last start winner (29.87) at Richmond in a Grade 5 and will jump from box 3 for the first time. Form here at this distance is sound. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Can make it two on the bounce. MONSOON ETHICS (1) comes here after a slick win at this track over 520m in 29.78. Harder here but expected to feature again. MAGIC SNOWDROP (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (29.34). Has ability and a bold showing is expected. URBAN VIVI (4) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
